_id":70266,"condition":"","answer":"Последний шаг! Как к вам обращаться и какой номер телефона лучше для связи?\r\n\r\nНапишите в формате:\r\nИмя: Ваше имя\r\nТелефон: +7...","description":"Контактные данные","x":-726,"y":5465,"message_type":0,"action_url":"","created_at":"2025-09-17T12:00:00.000Z","updated_at":"2026-09-18T06:57:07.738Z","show_answers":true,"attachment_url":"","attachment_type":"","file":null,"state_id":null,"request_type":null,"post_params":"","saved_variables":"","black_list":"","comparision_method":0,"enter_once":false,"hint":"Укажите имя и телефон\r\n\r\nДля возвращения в главное меню нажмите:\r\n1 - ↩️ Главное меню","headers":"","buttons":"[{\"line\":0,\"index_in_line\":0,\"text\":\"↩️ Главное меню\",\"type\":\"inline\",\"color\":\"#607D8B\"}]","variables":"Контакты = {message_text}; Имя = extract_name({message_text}); Телефон = extract_phone({message_text})","timeout":"","timeout_type":1,"compare_variable":"","priority":10,"clients_count":0,"list_action":null,"list_id":null,"enable_snippets":true,"show_connections_buttons":false,"enable_markdown":false,"sheet_id":null,"protected_content":false,"actions_settings":"{}","attachments_settings":"{\"attachments\":[]}","analytics_name":null,"analytics_category":null,"analytics_value":null,"disable_notification":false,"callback_if_seen":false,"response_only_to_callback":false,"enable_html":false,"show_caption_above_media":false,"save_to_log":true,"edit_previous_message":false,"extra_fields":"{}"},{"id":51889523,"project_id":70266,"condition":"","answer":"🌺 Спасибо! Ваш заказ принят!\r\n\r\n📋 Детали заказа:\r\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\r\n🎯 Получатель: #{Получатель}\r\n🌸 Тип: #{Тип_композиции}\r\n🎉 Повод: #{Повод}\r\n🎨 Цвета: #{Цвета}\r\n💰 Бюджет: #{Бюджет}\r\n💭 Пожелания: #{Пожелания}\r\n📅 Дата: #{Дата}\r\n🚚 Получение: #{Способ_получения}\r\n📍 Адрес: #{Адрес}\r\n👤 Контакты: #{Контакты}\r\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\r\n\r\n✨ Мы свяжемся с вами в течение 30 минут для уточнения деталей!\r\n\r\nСпасибо, что выбрали «Цветочную поэзию»! 💐","description":"Подтверждение заказа","x":-1060,"y":6100,"message_type":0,"action_url":"","created_at":"2025-09-17T12:00:00.000Z","updated_at":"2026-09-18T07:07:11.498Z","show_answers":true,"attachment_url":"","attachment_type":"","file":null,"state_id":null,"request_type":null,"post_params":"","saved_variables":"","black_list":"","comparision_method":0,"enter_once":false,"hint":"\r\n\r\nДля создания нового заказа нажмите:\r\n1 - 🌷 Новый заказ\r\n\r\nДля возврата в Главное меню нажмите:\r\n2 - 🏠 Главное меню","headers":"","buttons":"[{\"line\":0,\"index_in_line\":0,\"text\":\"🌷 Новый заказ\",\"type\":\"inline\",\"color\":\"#4CAF50\"},{\"line\":1,\"index_in_line\":0,\"text\":\"🏠 Главное меню\",\"type\":\"inline\",\"color\":\"#2196F3\"}]","variables":"order_complete = 'yes'; order_id = generate_order_id()","timeout":"","timeout_type":1,"compare_variable":"","priority":10,"clients_count":0,"list_action":null,"list_id":null,"enable_snippets":true,"show_connections_buttons":false,"enable_markdown":false,"sheet_id":null,"protected_content":false,"actions_settings":"{}","attachments_settings":"{\"attachments\":[]}","analytics_name":null,"analytics_category":null,"analytics_value":null,"disable_notification":false,"callback_if_seen":false,"response_only_to_callback":false,"enable_html":false,"show_caption_above_media":false,"save_to_log":true,"edit_previous_message":false,"extra_fields":"{}"},{"id":51889524,"project_id":70266,"condition":"","answer":"Привет! Мы — «Цветочная поэзия», место, где каждый букет создают с любовью и вдохновением. 🌸\r\n\r\n✨ Что нас отличает:\r\n• Свежие цветы ежедневно\r\n• Индивидуальный подход к каждому заказу\r\n• Профессиональные флористы\r\n• Доставка по Раменскому и области\r\n• Программа лояльности\r\n\r\nБудем рады помочь вам украсить любой праздник или просто поднять настроение!","description":"О компании","x":350,"y":20,"message_type":0,"action_url":"","created_at":"2025-09-17T12:00:00.000Z","updated_at":"2026-09-18T07:57:22.359Z","show_answers":true,"attachment_url":"","attachment_type":"","file":null,"state_id":null,"request_type":null,"post_params":"","saved_variables":"","black_list":"","comparision_method":0,"enter_once":false,"hint":"Чтобы перейти в раздел, отправьте мне его номер.\r\n\r\n1 - 🌷 Заказать букет\r\n2 - 📞 Контакты\r\n3 - 🏠 Главное меню","headers":"","buttons":"[{\"line\":0,\"index_in_line\":0,\"text\":\"🌷 Заказать букет\",\"type\":\"inline\",\"color\":\"#4CAF50\"},{\"line\":1,\"index_in_line\":0,\"text\":\"📞 Контакты\",\"type\":\"inline\",\"color\":\"#FF9800\"},{\"line\":2,\"index_in_line\":0,\"text\":\"🏠 Главное меню\",\"type\":\"inline\",\"color\":\"#2196F3\"}]","variables":"","timeout":"","timeout_type":1,"compare_variable":"","priority":10,"clients_count":0,"list_action":null,"list_id":null,"enable_snippets":true,"show_connections_buttons":false,"enable_markdown":false,"sheet_id":null,"protected_content":false,"actions_settings":"{}","attachments_settings":"{\"attachments\":[]}","analytics_name":null,"analytics_category":null,"analytics_value":null,"disable_notification":false,"callback_if_seen":false,"response_only_to_callback":false,"enable_html":false,"show_caption_above_media":false,"save_to_log":true,"edit_previous_message":false,"extra_fields":"{}"},{"id":51889525,"project_id":70266,"condition":"","answer":"Если хотите нас найти или позвонить — вот всё, что нужно знать:\r\n\r\n🏠 Адрес:\r\nг. Раменское, Северное шоссе, д. 14\r\n(вход со стороны ул. Профсоюзная)\r\n\r\n📱 Телефон:\r\n+7 (916) 486-72-25 (Telegram, MAX)\r\n\r\n⏰ Режим работы:\r\nЕжедневно с 9:00 до 21:00\r\n\r\nБудем рады видеть вас! 😊","description":"Контакты1","x":2560,"y":-210,"message_type":0,"action_url":"","created_at":"2025-09-17T12:00:00.000Z","updated_at":"2026-09-18T08:02:18.150Z","show_answers":true,"attachment_url":"","attachment_type":"","file":null,"state_id":null,"request_type":null,"post_params":"","saved_variables":"","black_list":"","comparision_method":0,"enter_once":false,"hint":"\r\nЧтобы перейти в раздел, отправьте мне его номер.\r\n\r\n1 - 🌷 Заказать букет\r\n2 - 🏠 Главное меню","headers":"","buttons":"[{\"line\":0,\"index_in_line\":0,\"text\":\"🌷 Заказать букет\",\"type\":\"inline\",\"color\":\"#4CAF50\"},{\"line\":1,\"index_in_line\":0,\"text\":\"🏠 Главное меню\",\"type\":\"inline\",\"color\":\"#2196F3\"}]","variables":"","timeout":"","timeout_type":1,"compare_variable":"","priority":10,"clients_count":0,"list_action":null,"list_id":null,"enable_snippets":true,"show_connections_buttons":false,"enable_markdown":false,"sheet_id":null,"protected_content":false,"actions_settings":"{}","attachments_settings":"{\"attachments\":[]}","analytics_name":null,"analytics_category":null,"analytics_value":null,"disable_notification":false,"callback_if_seen":false,"response_only_to_callback":false,"enable_html":false,"show_caption_above_media":false,"save_to_log":true,"edit_previous_message":false,"extra_fields":"{}"},{"id":54440177,"project_id":70266,"condition":"#{none}","answer":"Спасибо за обращение! Наш менеджер свяжется с вами в ближайшее время, чтобы ответить на все ваши вопросы и помочь с оформлением заказа.","description":"","x":1510,"y":910,"message_type":0,"action_url":"","created_at":"2025-11-07T15:45:34.724Z","updated_at":"2026-04-02T15:14:04.711Z","show_answers":true,"attachment_url":"","attachment_type":"","file":null,"state_id":null,"request_type":null,"post_params":"","saved_variables":"","black_list":"","comparision_method":0,"enter_once":false,"hint":"","headers":"","buttons":"","variables":"","timeout":"","timeout_type":1,"compare_variable":"","priority":10,"clients_count":0,"list_action":null,"list_id":null,"enable_snippets":true,"show_connections_buttons":true,"enable_markdown":false,"sheet_id":null,"protected_content":false,"actions_settings":"{}","attachments_settings":"{\"attachments\":[]}","analytics_name":null,"analytics_category":null,"analytics_value":null,"disable_notification":false,"callback_if_seen":false,"response_only_to_callback":false,"enable_html":false,"show_caption_above_media":false,"save_to_log":true,"edit_previous_message":false,"extra_fields":"{}"},{"id":59880796,"project_id":70266,"condition":"","answer":"Выберите вопрос","description":"","x":5150,"y":600,"message_type":0,"action_url":"","created_at":"2021-10-26T18:53:04.517Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T19:01:25.024Z","show_answers":true,"attachment_url":"","attachment_type":"","file":null,"state_id":null,"request_type":null,"post_params":"","saved_variables":"","black_list":"","comparision_method":0,"enter_once":false,"hint":"Чтобы перейти в раздел, отправьте мне его номер.\r\n\r\n1 - Как оплатить?\r\n2 - Можно ли оплатить при получении?\r\n3 - Можно ли оплатить картой в магазине?\r\n4 - Вернуться назад","headers":"","buttons":"[{\"line\":0,\"index_in_line\":0,\"text\":\"Как оплатить?\",\"type\":\"inline\",\"color\":\"#5181B8\"},{\"line\":1,\"index_in_line\":0,\"text\":\"Можно ли оплатить при получении?\",\"type\":\"inline\",\"color\":\"#E64646\"},{\"line\":2,\"index_in_line\":0,\"text\":\"Можно ли оплатить картой в магазине?\",\"type\":\"inline\"},{\"line\":3,\"index_in_line\":0,\"text\":\"Вернуться назад\",\"type\":\"inline\",\"color\":\"#050505\"}]","variables":"","timeout":"","timeout_type":1,"compare_variable":"","priority":10,"clients_count":0,"list_action":null,"list_id":null,"enable_snippets":true,"show_connections_buttons":true,"enable_markdown":false,"sheet_id":null,"protected_content":false,"actions_settings":"{}","attachments_settings":"{\"attachments\":[]}","analytics_name":null,"analytics_category":null,"analytics_value":null,"disable_notification":false,"callback_if_seen":false,"response_only_to_callback":false,"enable_html":false,"show_caption_above_media":false,"save_to_log":true,"edit_previous_message":false,"extra_fields":"{}"},{"id":59880798,"project_id":70266,"condition":"#{none}","answer":"Доставка осуществляется по Раменскому району. \r\nБолее подробная информация о зонах и стоимости доставки:\r\nhttps://flowerpoetry.ru/informaciya-o-dostavke","description":"","x":4640,"y":2050,"message_type":0,"action_url":"","created_at":"2021-10-26T19:22:09.296Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T19:03:44.778Z","show_answers":true,"attachment_url":"","attachment_type":"","file":null,"state_id":null,"request_type":null,"post_params":"","saved_variables":"","black_list":"","comparision_method":0,"enter_once":false,"hint":"","headers":"","buttons":"","variables":"","timeout":"","timeout_type":1,"compare_variable":"","priority":10,"clients_count":0,"list_action":null,"list_id":null,"enable_snippets":true,"show_connections_buttons":true,"enable_markdown":false,"sheet_id":null,"protected_content":false,"actions_settings":"{}","attachments_settings":"{}","analytics_name":null,"analytics_category":null,"analytics_value":null,"disable_notification":false,"callback_if_seen":false,"response_only_to_callback":false,"enable_html":false,"show_caption_above_media":false,"save_to_log":true,"edit_previous_message":false,"extra_fields":"{}"},{"id":59880799,"project_id":70266,"condition":"","answer":"Возможна. В этом случае обязательно укажите номер телефона и имя получателя. \r\n   Телефон нужен в том случае, если у получателя не работает домофон, не открывает дверь или куда-то отошел.\r\n   ВАЖНО!!! В некоторых случаях получатель отказывается принимать букет, если не знает от кого он.","description":"","x":3700,"y":2660,"message_type":0,"action_url":"","created_at":"2021-10-26T19:44:22.373Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T19:07:34.102Z","show_answers":true,"attachment_url":"","attachment_type":"","file":null,"state_id":null,"request_type":null,"post_params":"","saved_variables":"","black_list":"","comparision_method":0,"enter_once":false,"hint":"","headers":"","buttons":"","variables":"","timeout":"","timeout_type":1,"compare_variable":"","priority":10,"clients_count":0,"list_action":null,"list_id":null,"enable_snippets":true,"show_connections_buttons":true,"enable_markdown":false,"sheet_id":null,"protected_content":false,"actions_settings":"{}","attachments_settings":"{}","analytics_name":null,"analytics_category":null,"analytics_value":null,"disable_notification":false,"callback_if_seen":false,"response_only_to_callback":false,"enable_html":false,"show_caption_above_media":false,"save_to_log":true,"edit_previous_message":false,"extra_fields":"{}"},{"id":59880800,"project_id":70266,"condition":"","answer":"Мы стараемся собирать букет так, чтобы он был максимально похож с букетом на фото. Но у некоторых цветов есть сезонность, может быть разным раскрытие бутона, его размер и оттенок. Не всегда у нас есть в наличие весь набор используемых в букетах цветов. Поэтому не всегда получается собрать букет на 100% идентичным оригиналу. \r\n   В некоторых случаях мы согласовываем замену цветов, стараясь сохранить цветовую гамму.\r\n   В любом случае, после сборки букета, мы присылаем Вам его фото на согласование.","description":"","x":5010,"y":70,"message_type":0,"action_url":"","created_at":"2021-10-26T19:15:10.967Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T18:58:45.068Z","show_answers":true,"attachment_url":"","attachment_type":"","file":null,"state_id":null,"request_type":null,"post_params":"","saved_variables":"","black_list":"","comparision_method":0,"enter_once":false,"hint":"","headers":"","buttons":"","variables":"","timeout":"","timeout_type":1,"compare_variable":"","priority":10,"clients_count":0,"list_action":null,"list_id":null,"enable_snippets":true,"show_connections_buttons":true,"enable_markdown":false,"sheet_id":null,"protected_content":false,"actions_settings":"{}","attachments_settings":"{}","analytics_name":null,"analytics_category":null,"analytics_value":null,"disable_notification":false,"callback_if_seen":false,"response_only_to_callback":false,"enable_html":false,"show_caption_above_media":false,"save_to_log":true,"edit_previous_message":false,"extra_fields":"{}"},{"id":59880801,"project_id":70266,"condition":"","answer":"Вы можете оплатить заказ:\r\n1. Картой на сайте\r\n2. Переводом по номеру телефона или карты на Сбер или Тинькофф\r\n3. По ссылке на оплату. В этом случае оплата происходит картой. ","description":"","x":5680,"y":420,"message_type":0,"action_url":"","created_at":"2021-10-26T19:10:10.481Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T19:02:10.681Z","show_answers":true,"attachment_url":"","attachment_type":"","file":null,"state_id":null,"request_type":null,"post_params":"","saved_variables":"","black_list":"","comparision_method":0,"enter_once":false,"hint":"","headers":"","buttons":"","variables":"","timeout":"","timeout_type":1,"compare_variable":"","priority":10,"clients_count":0,"list_action":null,"list_id":null,"enable_snippets":true,"show_connections_buttons":true,"enable_markdown":false,"sheet_id":null,"protected_content":false,"actions_settings":"{}","attachments_settings":"{}","analytics_name":null,"analytics_category":null,"analytics_value":null,"disable_notification":false,"callback_if_seen":false,"response_only_to_callback":false,"enable_html":false,"show_caption_above_media":false,"save_to_log":true,"edit_previous_message":false,"extra_fields":"{}"},{"id":59880802,"project_id":70266,"condition":"","answer":"Да, в нашем магазине мы принимаем как наличную, так и безналичную оплату","description":"","x":5700,"y":980,"message_type":0,"action_url":"","created_at":"2021-10-26T19:13:42.828Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T19:02:16.651Z","show_answers":true,"attachment_url":"","attachment_type":"","file":null,"state_id":null,"request_type":null,"post_params":"","saved_variables":"","black_list":"","comparision_method":0,"enter_once":false,"hint":"","headers":"","buttons":"","variables":"","timeout":"","timeout_type":1,"compare_variable":"","priority":10,"clients_count":0,"list_action":null,"list_id":null,"enable_snippets":true,"show_connections_buttons":true,"enable_markdown":false,"sheet_id":null,"protected_content":false,"actions_settings":"{}","attachments_settings":"{}","analytics_name":null,"analytics_category":null,"analytics_value":null,"disable_notification":false,"callback_if_seen":false,"response_only_to_callback":false,"enable_html":false,"show_caption_above_media":false,"save_to_log":true,"edit_previous_message":false,"extra_fields":"{}"},{"id":59880803,"project_id":70266,"condition":"","answer":"Стоимость доставки зависит от стоимости букета и зоны доставки.\r\nБолее подробная информация о зонах и стоимости доставки:\r\nhttps://flowerpoetry.ru/informaciya-o-dostavke","description":"","x":4440,"y":2560,"message_type":0,"action_url":"","created_at":"2021-10-26T19:43:17.957Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T19:07:25.326Z","show_answers":true,"attachment_url":"","attachment_type":"","file":null,"state_id":null,"request_type":null,"post_params":"","saved_variables":"","black_list":"","comparision_method":0,"enter_once":false,"hint":"","headers":"","buttons":"","variables":"","timeout":"","timeout_type":1,"compare_variable":"","priority":10,"clients_count":0,"list_action":null,"list_id":null,"enable_snippets":true,"show_connections_buttons":true,"enable_markdown":false,"sheet_id":null,"protected_content":false,"actions_settings":"{}","attachments_settings":"{}","analytics_name":null,"analytics_category":null,"analytics_value":null,"disable_notification":false,"callback_if_seen":false,"response_only_to_callback":false,"enable_html":false,"show_caption_above_media":false,"save_to_log":true,"edit_previous_message":false,"extra_fields":"{}"},{"id":59880804,"project_id":70266,"condition":"","answer":"Многие цветы имеют сезонность или их просто не может оказаться в нужный момент у поставщиков. Поэтому, чем раньше Вы закажете букет, тем лучше. Идеальный вариант - сделать заказ за 2 недели. В этом случае мы успеем связаться с поставщиками и привезти необходимые цветы. Опять таки, если это возможно.\r\nP.S. Например пионы - летние цветы. Зимой их можно привезти, но стоить они будут значительно дороже, качество будет плохое, а бутоны будут маленькие.","description":"","x":5780,"y":-680,"message_type":0,"action_url":"","created_at":"2021-10-26T19:23:48.882Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T18:57:04.624Z","show_answers":true,"attachment_url":"","attachment_type":"","file":null,"state_id":null,"request_type":null,"post_params":"","saved_variables":"","black_list":"","comparision_method":0,"enter_once":false,"hint":"","headers":"","buttons":"","variables":"","timeout":"","timeout_type":1,"compare_variable":"","priority":10,"clients_count":0,"list_action":null,"list_id":null,"enable_snippets":true,"show_connections_buttons":true,"enable_markdown":false,"sheet_id":null,"protected_content":false,"actions_settings":"{}","attachments_settings":"{\"attachments\":[]}","analytics_name":null,"analytics_category":null,"analytics_value":null,"disable_notification":false,"callback_if_seen":false,"response_only_to_callback":false,"enable_html":false,"show_caption_above_media":false,"save_to_log":true,"edit_previous_message":false,"extra_fields":"{}"},{"id":59880805,"project_id":70266,"condition":"","answer":"Да, мы пришлем Вам фото букета перед его доставкой в Telegram, MAX или VK","description":"","x":5210,"y":-550,"message_type":0,"action_url":"","created_at":"2021-10-26T19:30:00.262Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T18:59:47.043Z","show_answers":true,"attachment_url":"","attachment_type":"","file":null,"state_id":null,"request_type":null,"post_params":"","saved_variables":"","black_list":"","comparision_method":0,"enter_once":false,"hint":"","headers":"","buttons":"","variables":"","timeout":"","timeout_type":1,"compare_variable":"","priority":10,"clients_count":0,"list_action":null,"list_id":null,"enable_snippets":true,"show_connections_buttons":true,"enable_markdown":false,"sheet_id":null,"protected_content":false,"actions_settings":"{}","attachments_settings":"{\"attachments\":[]}","analytics_name":null,"analytics_category":null,"analytics_value":null,"disable_notification":false,"callback_if_seen":false,"response_only_to_callback":false,"enable_html":false,"show_caption_above_media":f