null,"request_type":null,"post_params":"","saved_variables":"","black_list":"","comparision_method":0,"enter_once":false,"hint":"Чтобы перейти в раздел, отправьте мне его номер.\r\n\r\n1 - Отчет о доставке\r\n2 - Вы делаете фотоотчет?","headers":"","buttons":"[{\"line\":0,\"index_in_line\":0,\"text\":\"Отчет о доставке\",\"type\":\"inline\",\"color\":\"#5181B8\"},{\"line\":1,\"index_in_line\":0,\"text\":\"Вы делаете фотоотчет?\",\"type\":\"inline\",\"color\":\"#E64646\"},{\"line\":2,\"index_in_line\":0,\"text\":\"Вернуться назад\",\"type\":\"inline\",\"color\":\"#080808\"}]","variables":"","timeout":"","timeout_type":1,"compare_variable":"","priority":10,"clients_count":0,"list_action":null,"list_id":null,"enable_snippets":true,"show_connections_buttons":true,"enable_markdown":false,"sheet_id":null,"protected_content":false,"actions_settings":"{}","attachments_settings":"{\"attachments\":[]}","analytics_name":null,"analytics_category":null,"analytics_value":null,"disable_notification":false,"callback_if_seen":false,"response_only_to_callback":false,"enable_html":false,"show_caption_above_media":false,"save_to_log":true,"edit_previous_message":false,"extra_fields":"{}"},{"id":59880809,"project_id":70266,"condition":"","answer":"Выберите вопрос","description":"","x":4000,"y":2030,"message_type":0,"action_url":"","created_at":"2021-10-26T19:21:45.626Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T19:03:06.360Z","show_answers":true,"attachment_url":"","attachment_type":"","file":null,"state_id":null,"request_type":null,"post_params":"","saved_variables":"","black_list":"","comparision_method":0,"enter_once":false,"hint":"Чтобы перейти в раздел, отправьте мне его номер.\r\n\r\n1 - Куда осуществляется доставка?\r\n2 - Во сколько доставляете?\r\n3 - Сколько стоит доставка?\r\n4 - Возможна ли анонимная доставка?\r\n5 - Вернуться назад","headers":"","buttons":"[{\"line\":0,\"index_in_line\":0,\"text\":\"Куда осуществляется доставка\",\"type\":\"inline\",\"color\":\"#5181B8\"},{\"line\":1,\"index_in_line\":0,\"text\":\"Во сколько доставляете?\",\"type\":\"inline\",\"color\":\"#E64646\"},{\"line\":2,\"index_in_line\":0,\"text\":\"Сколько стоит доставка?\",\"type\":\"inline\",\"color\":\"#4BB34B\"},{\"line\":3,\"index_in_line\":0,\"text\":\"Возможна ли анонимная доставка?\",\"type\":\"inline\",\"color\":\"#fff952\"},{\"line\":4,\"index_in_line\":0,\"text\":\"Вернуться назад\",\"type\":\"inline\",\"color\":\"#050505\"}]","variables":"","timeout":"","timeout_type":1,"compare_variable":"","priority":10,"clients_count":0,"list_action":null,"list_id":null,"enable_snippets":true,"show_connections_buttons":true,"enable_markdown":false,"sheet_id":null,"protected_content":false,"actions_settings":"{}","attachments_settings":"{\"attachments\":[]}","analytics_name":null,"analytics_category":null,"analytics_value":null,"disable_notification":false,"callback_if_seen":false,"response_only_to_callback":false,"enable_html":false,"show_caption_above_media":false,"save_to_log":true,"edit_previous_message":false,"extra_fields":"{}"},{"id":59880810,"project_id":70266,"condition":"","answer":"В данный момент мы работаем с сервисом Яндекс Доставка, поэтому курьер не сможет принять оплату при получении букета.","description":"","x":5890,"y":780,"message_type":0,"action_url":"","created_at":"2021-10-26T19:12:18.892Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T19:02:46.085Z","show_answers":true,"attachment_url":"","attachment_type":"","file":null,"state_id":null,"request_type":null,"post_params":"","saved_variables":"","black_list":"","comparision_method":0,"enter_once":false,"hint":"","headers":"","buttons":"","variables":"","timeout":"","timeout_type":1,"compare_variable":"","priority":10,"clients_count":0,"list_action":null,"list_id":null,"enable_snippets":true,"show_connections_buttons":true,"enable_markdown":false,"sheet_id":null,"protected_content":false,"actions_settings":"{}","attachments_settings":"{\"attachments\":[]}","analytics_name":null,"analytics_category":null,"analytics_value":null,"disable_notification":false,"callback_if_seen":false,"response_only_to_callback":false,"enable_html":false,"show_caption_above_media":false,"save_to_log":true,"edit_previous_message":false,"extra_fields":"{}"},{"id":59880811,"project_id":70266,"condition":"","answer":"После того, как букет будет доставлен, мы пришлем Вам отчет о доставке сообщением в соц. сетях или мессенджере.","description":"","x":3510,"y":3260,"message_type":0,"action_url":"","created_at":"2021-10-26T19:49:26.737Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T19:07:54.071Z","show_answers":true,"attachment_url":"","attachment_type":"","file":null,"state_id":null,"request_type":null,"post_params":"","saved_variables":"","black_list":"","comparision_method":0,"enter_once":false,"hint":"","headers":"","buttons":"","variables":"","timeout":"","timeout_type":1,"compare_variable":"","priority":10,"clients_count":0,"list_action":null,"list_id":null,"enable_snippets":true,"show_connections_buttons":true,"enable_markdown":false,"sheet_id":null,"protected_content":false,"actions_settings":"{}","attachments_settings":"{\"attachments\":[]}","analytics_name":null,"analytics_category":null,"analytics_value":null,"disable_notification":false,"callback_if_seen":false,"response_only_to_callback":false,"enable_html":false,"show_caption_above_media":false,"save_to_log":true,"edit_previous_message":false,"extra_fields":"{}"},{"id":59880812,"project_id":70266,"condition":"","answer":"- Вы можете оформить заказ на сайте:\r\nhttps://flowerpoetry.ru\r\n\r\n- Написать в Telegram или MAX по номеру:\r\n+7(916) 486-72-25\r\n\r\n- Позвонить по номеру:\r\n+7(916) 486-72-25","description":"","x":4170,"y":-660,"message_type":0,"action_url":"","created_at":"2021-10-26T18:59:45.443Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T18:58:05.206Z","show_answers":true,"attachment_url":"","attachment_type":"","file":null,"state_id":null,"request_type":null,"post_params":"","saved_variables":"","black_list":"","comparision_method":0,"enter_once":false,"hint":"","headers":"","bu